commercial redistribution of the core, so a distribution of romdev that
bundles them is free for non-commercial use and is not labeled OSI open
source. (Your code is MIT and your compiled games are unencumbered; a cart
the recompiler builds for SMS/GG, Genesis or SNES contains code from these
